  "status": "Delivered studio-startup test APK; source, desktop renderer, package and Android metadata checks passed. Physical-phone verification remains open.",
  "changes": [
    "Replaces Godot's engine boot image with a custom studio still, then shows the original vertical stamp on a dark stage. Its muted deep-red ink grows and brightens in a double heartbeat before settling into the shared cream-wave reveal.",
    "A lightweight startup scene warms current runtime resources with real threaded loading. The normal presentation lasts at least 1.8 seconds and waits for both readiness and a rendered resting heartbeat frame; no invented loading percentage is displayed.",
    "Startup holds gameplay clocks, touches, onboarding and checkpoints until handoff. Profile restoration completes before lifecycle writes are allowed. Saved paused runs and pending results remain intact, and background time does not consume the animation or the run.",
    "Saved Reduced Motion is read before the first pulse and uses a static logo with immediate reveal once loading is ready. Loading failure provides usable Retry and Close controls, releasing failed loader tokens while preserving healthy pending resources.",
    "The supplied 301x855 studio stamp remains byte-exact; paper suppression, ink contrast and scale are rendered at runtime. The 720x1280 engine still was rendered from that same shader and is included as a raw PNG for early boot.",
    "All ten top-level gameplay data files, including prices, durability, economies and authored layouts, are byte-identical to v0.7.2."
  ],
